Usage: start_app.bat [--dev|--prod] [--backend-port PORT] [--frontend-port PORT]

  --dev             Start in development mode (default)
  --prod            Start in production mode
  --backend-port    Preferred backend port (default 8000)
  --frontend-port   Preferred frontend port (default 3000)

If a preferred port is busy, the script automatically picks the next free port.
